<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en">

<head>

  <meta charset="UTF-8" />

  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

  <title>CodeBlog</title>

  <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/style.css" />

</head>

<body>

  <nav class="top-nav">


    <h2>CodeBlog</h2>

    <div class="user-menu">


      <span>Hi, <%= user %></span>

      <a href="/logout">Logout</a>

    </div>

  </nav>

  <main>

    <section class="intro-section">

      <h1>

        Learning, building

        <br />

        and sharing code.

      </h1>

      <p>

        A simple developer blog where I share programming tips,

        web development ideas, projects and coding experiences.

      </p>

    </section>

    <section class="blog-container">

      <article class="blog-card">

        <span>REACT JS</span>

        <h2>Getting Started With React Components</h2>

        <p>

          Learn how React components work and how they help

          us create simple and reusable user interfaces.

        </p>

        <a href="#">Read article →</a>

      </article>

      <article class="blog-card">

        <span>NODE JS</span>

        <h2>Building a Simple Express Server</h2>

        <p>

          Learn the basics of Node.js and Express by creating

          a simple backend server and handling different routes.

        </p>

        <a href="#">Read article →</a>

      </article>

      <article class="blog-card">

        <span>MONGODB</span>

        <h2>Understanding MongoDB Database</h2>

        <p>

          A beginner-friendly introduction to MongoDB,

          collections, documents and storing application data.

        </p>

        <a href="#">Read article →</a>

      </article>

    </section>


  </main>

</body>

</html>